msgctxt "#32018"
msgid "Search index field"
msgstr "Search index field"

msgctxt "#32019"
msgid "Which database field to store and match the T9 search index. originaltitle is the default; sorttitle can be used as an alternative if originaltitle is needed for other purposes."
msgstr "Which database field to store and match the T9 search index. originaltitle is the default; sorttitle can be used as an alternative if originaltitle is needed for other purposes."

