msgstr "sorttitle"

msgctxt "#32022"
msgid "Auto write search index"
msgstr "Auto write search index"

msgctxt "#32023"
msgid "When enabled, the plugin will automatically write T9 search index data to the selected search field for movies and TV shows."
msgstr "When enabled, the plugin will automatically write T9 search index data to the selected search field for movies and TV shows."

msgctxt "#32024"
msgid "Autofill/fix playlist for current episode or folder"
msgstr "Autofill/fix playlist for current episode or folder"

msgctxt "#32025"
msgid "When enabled, starting an episode or a video file from a folder will automatically fill and sort the current playlist with the full season or all videos in that folder. For scraped TV shows, misplaced or out-of-order episodes are also corrected. Up to 50 items before and 50 after the current item are kept."
msgstr "When enabled, starting an episode or a video file from a folder will automatically fill and sort the current playlist with the full season or all videos in that folder. For scraped TV shows, misplaced or out-of-order episodes are also corrected. Up to 50 items before and 50 after the current item are kept."

